WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.719
Baa! Baa!

2
00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:06.219
The Royal Bedroom was full of sheep!

3
00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:09.430
"Sheep!" the queen yelled.

4
00:00:09.431 --> 00:00:12.343
She jumped into the king's arms.

5
00:00:12.344 --> 00:00:14.392
Tom stared at the sheep.

6
00:00:14.393 --> 00:00:16.704
"Oops!" he said.

7
00:00:16.705 --> 00:00:18.565
Dirk grinned.

8
00:00:18.566 --> 00:00:25.368
"Now Tom will go to the Grim Dungeon!" he thought.

9
00:00:25.369 --> 00:00:30.374
"What's going on?" the king roared.

10
00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:32.599
He walked among the sheep.

11
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.543
Dirk followed the king.

12
00:00:34.544 --> 00:00:37.973
Then the king turned—and stepped on Dirk's foot.

13
00:00:37.974 --> 00:00:43.858
"Ouch!" Dirk hopped behind the king.

14
00:00:43.859 --> 00:00:47.279
"Your Majesty, I told Tom to make a drink!

15
00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.704
I didn't say sheep!"

16
00:00:49.705 --> 00:00:52.205
"Hrmpf!" the king said.

17
00:00:52.206 --> 00:00:56.414
"There are so many sheep!" the queen cried.

18
00:00:56.415 --> 00:01:05.988
The king began counting them. "One, two . . ."

19
00:01:05.989 --> 00:01:09.992
His eyelids felt heavy and he yawned.

20
00:01:09.993 --> 00:01:18.780
Suddenly the king fell—into Tom's arms!

21
00:01:18.781 --> 00:01:23.868
The king slept until the next morning.

22
00:01:23.869 --> 00:01:39.684
Tom and Cat brought the sheep outside.

23
00:01:39.685 --> 00:01:43.446
The sheep stayed under the king's window.

24
00:01:43.447 --> 00:01:54.250
Every night the king fell asleep—counting sheep!

25
00:01:54.251 --> 00:01:58.945
"I fall asleep before I count to ten," the king said.

26
00:01:58.946 --> 00:02:03.130
"Thank you, Tom!"

27
00:02:03.131 --> 00:02:07.425
Dirk was stuck taking care of the sheep.

28
00:02:07.426 --> 00:02:14.845
"I'll get that wizard!" he grumbled.

29
00:02:14.846 --> 00:02:17.614
The king was happy.

30
00:02:17.615 --> 00:02:20.032
But the queen was not.

31
00:02:20.033 --> 00:02:24.290
She still couldn't get any beauty sleep.

32
00:02:24.291 --> 00:02:32.014
The king's snoring kept her awake!

